Description: INDI Allsky web dashboard and remote sync portal
 indi-allsky-web provides the standalone Flask web interface, Gunicorn
 application server, and web server configuration for INDI Allsky.
 It can be deployed on a remote server, VPS, or central dashboard to view
 images and sync data without requiring local camera hardware or INDI drivers.

